From 8d3d08724dee52930affd67854f71bcf7c5fa964 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 14:54:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] gui: on-device review round 2 + header/rail consistency (NOT
 built)

Theming round 2:
- SDN.asp + MLO.asp recolored at the BUNDLE level (sdn.css/mlo.css hex
  values swapped teal/blue -> reaper) - guaranteed to apply, unlike the
  injected section-13 backstop.
- View List modal (device-map/clientlist.css, .RT skin) dark-themed.
- USB network-map icons: crimson filter + transparent bg (kills teal 2.0
  icon and rose square behind 3.0).
- AiMesh client-list default icon tile -> black (custom icons untouched).
- GameBoost game_priority wide ON/OFF slider: contrast fix (dark track,
  bone knob, readable labels) after the global grey-toggle recolor.
- Operation Mode diagram now points at rt_reaper.png (transparent) - the
  stock rt.jpg is a JPEG with a baked teal box; USER MUST PLACE the PNG.

Header/rail consistency:
- Left rail widened 250->264px + wordmark nowrap/18px so ASUS.Merlin.Reaper
  fits one line on both dashboard and shell.
- Shell topbar standardized to the dashboard geometry (logo 34px, padding
  10x18, btn sizing) and GAINED the live status pills (WAN/Mode/Uptime/
  Firmware/Clients/Mesh) + a populate script, so every framed page shows an
  identical header. Same pill-drop media queries.
- Removed the coming-soon search box from Main_ReaperDash.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
